  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    Welcome to Fuel Frenzy!


    Race against the AI opponent
    and

    collect fuel pickups along the track.


    Manage your fuel carefully
    and use

    boosts strategically to win the race.


    CONTROLS

    WASD /
    Arrow Keys - Drive and Steer

    Space - Brake

    Q - Mix / Use Fuel

    F
    - Dump Fuel

    R - Reset Car'
